│ clinical trials evaluating clinical efficacy of different strategies. A comprehensive integrated strategy with       │
│ consideration to financial and other limitations should be applied to each specific area."}, {"study_index": 53,     │
│ "title": "Factors that influence participation in physical activity for people with bipolar disorder: a synthesis of │
