│ hospital at home compared with inpatient hospital care.cochranelibrary.com"}, {"study_index": 56, "title":           │
│ "Encountering staff in the home: Three older adults’ experience duringsix months of home-based rehabilitation",      │
│ "abstract": "PURPOSE The purpose of the present study was to explore and describe how older adults who received      │
│ home-based rehabilitation perceived the staff during a period of 6 months when they received rehabilitation.         │
│ Specifically, the study focused on how the participants collaborated with and made use of the services from the      │
