│ me’–contributing factors to nonattendance/noncompletion at phase III cardiac rehabilitation in acute coronary        │
│ syndrome patients: a qualitative enquiry", "abstract": "AIMS AND OBJECTIVES To explore what reasons do nonattenders  │
│ and noncompleters give for their patterns of participation or nonparticipation in cardiac rehabilitation programmes  │
