│ a focus on how they were planned and implemented so as to maximize their potential benefits. The chapter will close  │
│ with a discussion of obstacles and challenges facing telerehabilitation and suggestions for ways to promote its      │
│ growth in use and acceptance.ebooks.iospress.nl"}, {"study_index": 62, "title": "Inpatient versus home-based         │
