│ Although physiotherapists were initially skeptical about the effectiveness of telephone‐delivered service models to  │
│ patients with knee OA, perceptions shifted once they experienced delivery of care via this nontraditional method.    │
│ Our findings suggest that firsthand experience may be necessary for physiotherapists to embrace new models of        │
│ service delivery. Wiley Online Library"}, {"study_index": 153, "title": "Development of a wheelchair skills home     │
